  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\nf(x)=\\frac{(x-1)(x-5)}{(x-2)(x-3)}\n$$\nThe graph of $f(x)$ is shown\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/wvp0nANowQRUUqEKwDE04wK9eFTqRImRXTt4B2hjHOM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n(A) If $-1 < x < 1 \\Rightarrow 0 < f(x) < 1$\n(B) If $1 < x < 2 \\Rightarrow f(x) < 0$\n(C) If $3 < x < 5 \\Rightarrow f(x) < 0$\n(D) If $x>5 \\Rightarrow 0 < f(x) < 1$",
    "image": null
